# Cache kill-switch — when set to "1", bypasses every in-process + Redis
# cache. Use for demos that need to show cold-start AI latency on purpose.
# Cart cache is exempt (correctness, not perf). Per-request override:
# `?fresh=1` URL param on /api/layout and /api/suggest.
AISLES_NO_CACHE=
